# ─── Gate-context hygiene (2026-08-16) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Gate attempt 4's context transfer hit 639MB+ and was still climbing at 24
# minutes: the two aborted bind-mount gate runs left a LINUX pnpm store on the
# host (.pnpm-ci), and a legacy repo-local .pnpm-store predates it — both were
# being tarred into every docker build context (production Dockerfile's too).
